  "scenario": "A first-time handheld buyer wants a Nintendo Switch for a train commute. A local shop describes an OLED screen upgrade as roughly 100 dollars over a base model, but the frozen corpus does not contain a matched current offer supporting that gap. It contains two non-matched seller pages, historical launch MSRP and model-family specifications, generic LCD/OLED and battery concepts, individual Switch opinions, a Steam Deck commute discussion, and an OLED-TV discussion with conflicting screen-wear experiences.",
